B.BH=new A.fB("King Charles I",B.cD,"assets/images/cards/card_charles.png","A King whose religious policies ignited rebellion across Scotland...","King of England, Scotland, and Ireland whose attempts to impose the Anglican Book of Common Prayer on Presbyterian Scotland sparked the National Covenant of 1638.")
B.BL=new A.fB("William Burke",B.cD,"assets/images/cards/card_burke.png","One half of Edinburgh's most infamous murderous duo...","Irish immigrant who, along with William Hare, murdered at least 16 people in 1828 to sell their corpses to Dr Robert Knox for anatomical dissection. Hanged in 1829.")
B.BK=new A.fB("William Hare",B.cD,"assets/images/cards/card_hare.png","The partner who turned King's evidence to save his own neck...","Partner in crime to William Burke. Offered immunity from prosecution in exchange for testifying against Burke. Released from prison and fled Scotland.")
