B.BJ=new A.fB('George "Bluidy" McKenzie',B.im,"assets/images/cards/card_mckenzie.png","The ruthless Lord Advocate who earned his terrifying nickname...",'Sir George Mackenzie of Rosehaugh, Lord Advocate under Charles II, known as "Bluidy Mackenzie" for his brutal prosecution of the Covenanters.')
B.BF=new A.fB("Henrietta Maria",B.m7,"assets/images/cards/card_henrietta.png","Behind every king, a queen who changed history...","Queen consort of England, Scotland, and Ireland as the wife of King Charles I. Her Roman Catholic faith and influence on the court fueled Scottish Presbyterian suspicion.")
