B.H5=s(["Unclaimed bodies from poorhouses","Bodies of executed criminals","Donations from wealthy patrons","Bodies purchased from foreign countries"],t.s)
B.NO=new A.bF("apprentice_q2",B.as,"Before the Anatomy Act of 1832, what was the only legal source of corpses for medical dissection in Scotland?",B.H5,1,"By law, only the corpses of executed criminals could be used for dissection. As medical schools grew, this limited supply couldn't meet demand, giving rise to the body-snatching trade.",null,null,null,null,null,null)
