B.NC=new A.bF("apprentice_q5",B.cj,"Which of these fates befell the captured Covenanters imprisoned at Greyfriars?",B.GO,B.jo,"The Covenanters suffered all four fates: many died from the brutal conditions, others were executed, some were shipped overseas as labourers, and some were offered freedom if they accepted the king's beliefs. There was no ransom system.",null,null,null,null,null,null)
